<title>Methods &amp; sources — Caldoria National Statistics</title>
<meta name="description" content="How the National Statistics Office of Caldoria collects, checks and revises every figure on this site.">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
<script type="module" src="app.js"></script>
</head>
<body data-page="methods">
<div class="topbar"><div class="topbar-inner"><span>Official statistics of the Republic of Caldoria</span><span>Updated 26 November 2026</span></div></div>
<header class="site"><div class="header-inner">
<a class="brand" href="index.html"><svg class="brand-mark" viewBox="0 0 52 52" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="52" height="52" rx="8" fill="#e8a13a"/><circle cx="26" cy="22" r="11" fill="#0b5e5a"/><rect x="10" y="36" width="10" height="7" fill="#083f3d"/><rect x="23" y="36" width="6" height="7" fill="#083f3d"/><rect x="32" y="36" width="10" height="7" fill="#083f3d"/></svg><span><h1>Caldoria Statistics</h1><p>National Statistics Office of Caldoria</p></span></a>
<nav class="main" aria-label="Main navigation">
<a href="index.html">Home</a><a href="population.html">Population</a><a href="economy.html">Economy</a><a href="labour.html">Labour</a><a href="prices.html">Prices</a><a href="regions.html">Regions</a><a href="methods.html" class="active">Methods &amp; sources</a>
</nav>
